              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is delicious! We make it quite often, and sometimes substitute green chiles, which aren't quite as hot. We've also used king crab, which is more readily available. Served with white jasmine rice, it's really messy, but really addicting!"
          },
